# CODEOWNERS — Smatchet sensitive-path review map.
#
# Format: <pattern> <owner>... — patterns follow .gitignore semantics, later
# entries override earlier matches for the same path. See:
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-customization/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Today @alexandrosk0 is the sole owner. CODEOWNERS is INFORMATIONAL until
# branch protection is reconfigured to require code-owner review — the file
# documents what the project considers sensitive and gives a single edit
# point when additional owners are added.
#
# Phase 7a of docs/design/git-ref-plan-locks.md.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Plan-lock coordination infrastructure (git-ref-plan-locks)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The primitive scripts + helpers that touch refs/locks/* on origin. A
# malicious or buggy edit here can race-corrupt any in-flight slice's claim.
